    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Structured programs to disarm, demobilize, and reintegrate ex-combatants into civilian life, including psychosocial support, vocational training, and small arms and light weapons control." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "DDR programs in post-conflict settings providing vocational skills and psychosocial support to former fighters." ;
