        "Metal manufacturing",
        "Steel industry" ;
    skos:broader uei:EconomicDevelopment ;
    skos:closeMatch dac:32263 ;
    skos:definition "Programs and investments to develop basic metal production and processing capacity, including iron, steel, and non-ferrous metals manufacturing in developing countries." ;
    skos:exactMatch dac:32169 ;
    skos:example "A development finance loan to rehabilitate a state-owned steel rolling mill to supply local construction and manufacturing industries." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "metal smelting",
