    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A change to the presentation or organization of choices intended to influence behavior while preserving available options and avoiding substantial changes to financial incentives." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Behavioral nudges" ;
