    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Behavior-change, information, reminder, or outreach messages delivered through digital channels." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Digital messaging interventions" .

