    skos:scopeNote "Covers policy and institutional frameworks for agriculture; distinct from direct on-farm interventions." .

<https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/AgriculturalServicesIntervention>
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://universalevidence.com/ontology/Intervention> ;
