    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A program establishes agricultural service centres providing machinery hire, soil testing, and market price information to smallholder farmers." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "agricultural support services" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "farm mechanization services" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Agricultural services" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/AgriculturalExtension> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/AgriculturalInputSupport> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/FisheryServicesIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/ForestryServicesIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/VeterinaryServicesIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Covers general services to the agricultural sector not captured by extension, inputs, or research categories." .

