    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Programs, standards, and incentives designed to reduce energy consumption and improve energy efficiency on the demand side, including building efficiency, appliance standards, and behavioral change." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D003246> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://webfs.oecd.org/crs-iati-xml/Lookup/DAC-CRS-CODES.xml#23183> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A national program to subsidize energy-efficient cookstoves and reduce household fuel consumption." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "DSM" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "demand side management" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "energy conservation" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Energy conservation and demand-side efficiency intervention" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/CleanCookingAppliancesManufacturingIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/ElectricVehicleSmartChargingIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/EnergyPolicyAdministration> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/FuelwoodCharcoalIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/HeatPlantIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/RenewableEnergyGenerationIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/SolarThermalIntervention> ;
