    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000092843> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000985> ;
