    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "outbreak response" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Infectious disease control intervention" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/BloodCultureIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/PersonalProtectiveEquipmentIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/interventions/TuberculosisTreatmentIntervention> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Covers infectious disease control broadly; more specific interventions such as malaria control, immunization programs, and TB treatment have their own concepts." .

